Each doubling of K roughly DOUBLES the speedup. iters/window stays at
2 throughout, max|par-seq| at float32 machine precision. This confirms
the K=32 plateau in the earlier scaling sweep was the serial scan over
num_windows = T/K. Sequential time is essentially flat (~57 ms);
parallel time scales like 1/K and is dominated by the outer serial
scan up through K~1024.

